issue_context.body:
### Godot version

4.1.2.stable.mono

### System information

Desktop

### Issue description

The Window::move_to_foreground() and Window::grab_focus() methods in the Window class contain duplicated code that serves the same purpose.

```cpp
void Window::move_to_foreground() {
	ERR_MAIN_THREAD_GUARD;
	if (embedder) {
		embedder->_sub_window_grab_focus(this);
	} else if (window_id != DisplayServer::INVALID_WINDOW_ID) {
		DisplayServer::get_singleton()->window_move_to_foreground(window_id);
	}
}

void Window::grab_focus() {
	ERR_MAIN_THREAD_GUARD;
	if (embedder) {
		embedder->_sub_window_grab_focus(this);
	} else if (window_id != DisplayServer::INVALID_WINDOW_ID) {
		DisplayServer::get_singleton()->window_move_to_foreground(window_id);
	}
}
```


### Steps to reproduce

Open [scene/main/window.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/main/window.cpp)

### Minimal reproduction project

not needed
